---
description: Load when editing financial formulas, price normalization, signal thresholds or market-data validation.
alwaysApply: false
---

- Read `docs/FORMULAS.md` before changing financial logic.
- Use Decimal arithmetic; never rely on JavaScript floating-point for money calculations.
- Normalize and validate currency, unit, source and timestamp before calculation.
- Preserve supplied formulas until dimensional consistency and units are approved.
- Add boundary, equality, invalid-input, stale-data and source-conflict tests.
- If inputs or units are ambiguous, stop and ask; do not guess.
